WEBVTT

00:12:58.774 --> 00:13:01.985
and if she is, we'll make sure
that she gets this message.

00:13:03.362 --> 00:13:06.323
Jane, we have a question from Kat,

00:13:06.365 --> 00:13:10.911
who is joining us from the TEDxWomen
in Vail, Colorado.

00:13:11.245 --> 00:13:16.041
And you may have done this just now,
but I'm sure there are others, she asked,

00:13:16.083 --> 00:13:21.171
"Could you describe what are your most
joyful moments as a climate activist?"

00:13:24.091 --> 00:13:26.885
JF: Well, frankly, I got back
from Texas yesterday,

00:13:26.927 --> 00:13:29.721
and my body is still humming

00:13:29.763 --> 00:13:35.185
with the thrill of working
with these young people.